      en: ["It is the residence of the Queen Mother, the spiritual head of state", "The village consists of numerous traditional beehive-style huts", "Main venue for the annual Umhlanga (Reed Dance) ceremony", "Site of the Incwala, the most important religious ritual of Eswatini", "Located in the Ezulwini Valley, the heart of the kingdom", "The royal cattle kraal is used as a traditional parliament"],
      es: ["Distancia a Lobamba: 5 km", "Número de chozas tradicionales: 40", "Número de empleados fijos: 200", "Participantes anuales en el Umhlanga: 20.000", "Edad de la aldea (fundada): 1750 (aprox.)", "Diámetro de una choza: 6 m"],
      pt: ["Distância a Lobamba: 5 km", "Número de cabanas tradicionais: 40", "Número de funcionários fixos: 200", "Participantes anuais no Umhlanga: 20.000", "Idade da aldeia (fundada): 1750 (aprox.)", "Diâmetro de uma cabana: 6 m"],
      fr: ["Distance de Lobamba : 5 km", "Nombre de huttes traditionnelles : 40", "Nombre d'employés permanents : 200", "Participants annuels à l'Umhlanga : 20 000", "Âge du village (fondé) : 1750 (env.)", "Diamètre d'une hutte : 6 m"],
