      en: ["The market is the central commercial hub of Mbabane city", "Famous for hand-woven baskets made from indigenous grass", "Features a dedicated section for traditional healers and 'Muti'", "Sells a wide variety of fresh local produce and spices", "A key site for purchasing authentic Swazi wood carvings", "The market serves as a major social gathering place for residents"],
      es: ["Año de apertura: 1978", "Número de puestos: 200", "Visitantes diarios: 5.000", "Área de mercado: 10.000 m²", "Número de comerciantes fijos: 150", "Horario: 6:00–18:00"],
