      en: ["Swazi Plaza opened in the late 1970s as Eswatini's first major shopping mall.", "The complex features over 150 individual retail outlets and service points.", "It acts as a primary headquarters for the nation's banking sector.", "Includes the Swazi Plaza Corporate Centre, a multi-story office building.", "Centrally located, it is the busiest pedestrian area in the entire capital.", "The mall features major anchor tenants like Shoprite and various fashion brands."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 1985", "Superficie: 25.000 m²", "Más de 80 tiendas", "2 millones de visitantes anuales", "Terminal de autobuses conectada", "Edificio más alto de Mbabane: 15 m"],
      pt: ["Inaugurado em 1985", "Área: 25.000 m²", "Mais de 80 lojas", "2 milhões de visitantes anuais", "Terminal de autocarros ligada", "Edifício mais alto de Mbabane: 15 m"],
      fr: ["Inauguré en 1985", "Surface : 25 000 m²", "Plus de 80 magasins", "2 millions de visiteurs annuels", "Gare routière connectée", "Bâtiment le plus haut de Mbabane : 15 m"],
